# Cool but Rude, level 2: "Whenever you discard a card, this Class deals 2 damage to each opponent." Each card of a
# discard is its own event (CR 701.9a), so two cards discarded together trigger it twice. Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Class
# and, with the other two mana of a Mountain and the Moxen, pays {1}{R} for Level 2 (still no damage: nothing has been
# discarded). Turn 3 Faithless Looting draws two and discards two cards (a Bolt and a Swamp): 2 + 2 damage, Bot2 at 16.

